<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h2 data-lake-id="Vz9oD" id="Vz9oD" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ud81f51c0" id="ud81f51c0">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="u09e6c769" id="u09e6c769"> 𝐆𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐑𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐝𝐮𝐚𝐥</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0bb9196d" id="u0bb9196d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8fa5f17e" id="u8fa5f17e">残差连接为每个块提供通向网络输出的直接路径。预归一化能够维持大规模训练的稳定性，但也会削弱各层接收到的信号：所有块读取同一条残差流，因此，较早写入的特征必须与后续写入的全部信息竞争。已有研究通过增加额外路径缓解这一瓶颈，包括稠密的层间连接、针对注意力值向量的额外残差路径，以及缓存状态的跨层复用。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u13fb92ca" id="u13fb92ca">直接修改残差路径的方法主要分为两类</span></p><ul list="ub83f442c"><li fid="u9eacabf8" data-lake-id="ud1ff4129" id="ud1ff4129"><span data-lake-id="u93d2610e" id="u93d2610e">第一类沿用 Highway Networks 的思路，增强各层读取与写入操作的表达能力</span></li><li fid="u9eacabf8" data-lake-id="u52c0b206" id="u52c0b206"><span data-lake-id="u5bfb98ba" id="u5bfb98ba">第二类则拓宽残差流本身：Alternating Updates（AltUp）和 Hyper-Connections（HC）以多个并行分支替代单一残差向量。这两类方法具有互补性：拓宽残差流增加容量，更丰富的读写机制则决定如何利用这些容量</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1ec6b833" id="u1ec6b833"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f852f8d" id="u4f852f8d">拓宽残差流：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5e08d412" id="u5e08d412">首先采用适用于预归一化网络的简化 AltUp 变体，考察已有性能收益中有多少仅来自残差宽度的增加。第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F08843ad184698b2d78d7a39e060b9574.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lODMS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf0e50407" id="uf0e50407">个块之前的残差状态由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F413fbaa9f52eee23f525d65b922def78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i6RtS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4bf4fea4" id="u4bf4fea4">个分支构成，记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_r%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff01821649b5784081912cae14566ce8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gIemG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76730e76" id="u76730e76">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wsKBs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3699be4e" id="u3699be4e">为隐藏维度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6975549f153bc61e7c339441ff3e73fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XpShh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fe01732" id="u8fe01732">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CNcfn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6db1fca2" id="u6db1fca2">个分支。每个块包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F413fbaa9f52eee23f525d65b922def78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SXHIc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u54dc5e71" id="u54dc5e71">个可学习标量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_r%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1733cb1078f70047a31c6a9f7fa06d37.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IlOTY%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73decd4e" id="u73decd4e">，并通过对各分支加权求和读取输入</span></p><p data-lake-id="udb8b04d6" id="udb8b04d6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bn_r%7D%5Cnh_i%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B21%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F05a999abef359fd227ac56a2512e1ef1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Inp0o%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1a2c920f"><li fid="uda6aa3aa" data-lake-id="u00b7593c" id="u00b7593c"><span data-lake-id="u811bc96b" id="u811bc96b">随后，将块输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1fa4b3014932b58c45f272a565e334d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fxVyB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6353120" id="ud6353120">写回单个分支，写入分支按照网络深度循环选择</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u35b7c4ef" id="u35b7c4ef" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell%2B1)%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cni%3D%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cbmod%20n_r%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B22%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F00717ad06e9cd3cd9f297d527e6bacec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22B4A2Z%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf5ab60ea"><li fid="ubb9644b5" data-lake-id="u8de2bfa8" id="u8de2bfa8"><span data-lake-id="ue02ef3e6" id="ue02ef3e6">这一设计仅为每个块增加</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F413fbaa9f52eee23f525d65b922def78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f46am%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u572e3960" id="u572e3960">个参数，不引入矩阵乘法，因此计算成本可以忽略；额外开销主要来自维护</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F413fbaa9f52eee23f525d65b922def78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cuqix%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u893b2f0f" id="u893b2f0f">条分支而非单条残差流所增加的访存。在一个使用 4000 亿个词元训练的 25B-A3B MoE 模型上，这一改动使训练损失降低约 0.01。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u26e772c8" id="u26e772c8" style="color: #5C0036">因此，仅拓宽残差流就能带来明显的损失下降。接下来需要确定的是，在拓宽后的残差流上增加多大程度的读写复杂度，才能在性能、效率与稳定性之间取得良好平衡</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u86e7684b" id="u86e7684b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3bcc92ca" id="u3bcc92ca">Hyper-Connections：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue017f892" id="ue017f892">读取算子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F625a0a26bb0652e2e318ad3f78537dfc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vGiWD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7e64eec" id="ue7e64eec">构造块输入，写入算子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51ba8d61bf2240e2837efe718bad9e01.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RYe3n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u356e2738" id="u356e2738">将块输出分配至各分支，混合算子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc600cd47484dc83697fdca86b7d2825.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aqa8v%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucbb587fc" id="ucbb587fc">则在分支之间交换信息</span></p><p data-lake-id="u60b1c5e6" id="u60b1c5e6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B23%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0cb4bea7ba46baf38e3813e750dda9b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i7S6C%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u26f18d9b" id="u26f18d9b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B24%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F08bc521ffda5297f5bc090b7b3b6f4ab.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bqG6N%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3575df66" id="u3575df66" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell%2B1)%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B25%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4fc403262f3530c8825fb2191dccb4de.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A71VA%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ueef54a0e"><li fid="u6c2ea60f" data-lake-id="u5b8c096b" id="u5b8c096b"><span data-lake-id="u0b531e9e" id="u0b531e9e">三个算子均根据残差状态预测。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bnorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffdf297c5f49bbe3f6af938c8d9f31ac1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22idZqG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefc8c3f2" id="uefc8c3f2">表示归一化后的分支状态，则每个算子均由静态项与数据依赖项相加得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8ac1b521" id="u8ac1b521" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Clambda_m%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cphi%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_m%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B26%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F60b6b728fc3c5ca062ec50c1c9c8f11f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22U36m9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udff973f6" id="udff973f6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Clambda_c%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cphi%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_c%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B27%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F03ea8819805c70bde2cd654f407aeac1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uWfAD%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uad8bfe35" id="uad8bfe35" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Clambda_r%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cphi%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_r%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B28%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc1944d12b7d8c99216c809060af16419.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l92Mr%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8ab51eed"><li fid="u2a6755c9" data-lake-id="uba1afe9a" id="uba1afe9a"><span data-lake-id="u399e8933" id="u399e8933">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F89febb477c961a6ee99f4b8e83783254.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WBjXG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42044022" id="u42044022">为可学习的静态项，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0dc6f83ed3311b03e45a8cd040776669.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vKWKX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u58df31e8" id="u58df31e8">用于投影归一化后的残差，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff547e08b7db926659f19deee4b4363d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NSpJa%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufcfc96ef" id="ufcfc96ef">为激活函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F432b622b121dac04b6b2e58313104b32.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eQUqI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucccc9f93" id="ucccc9f93">为可学习的缩放参数。HC 使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%3D%5C%5Ctanh%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1e4402f6855acf659a1c37500bccd33c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tHk66%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57b88c67" id="u57b88c67">，并将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F432b622b121dac04b6b2e58313104b32.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iaM86%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1991edb" id="ud1991edb">初始化为 0.01；mHC 使用 sigmoid，并进一步将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc600cd47484dc83697fdca86b7d2825.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22awWQu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1780f7d1" id="u1780f7d1">约束在双随机矩阵流形上</span></li><li fid="u2a6755c9" data-lake-id="u478bf7c6" id="u478bf7c6"><span data-lake-id="u81f9ebce" id="u81f9ebce">具体而言，将静态项设置为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7B%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cbmod%20n_r%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F081090adfbb422cd38d7e1f45c5f25b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SgaKx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0251bab" id="uc0251bab">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F593bc4126c976955cfec8fbdb715c9f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wVrON%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7884a25c" id="u7884a25c">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba18913a7f1b698a32ddc4aa0754e9e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rym6G%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5bafe05" id="ud5bafe05">。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faca93ceebf9ebcad7c92e7081260165b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vRpO0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u66d801a7" id="u66d801a7"> 时，这一初始化使拓宽后的网络从与预归一化基线完全一致的状态开始训练；若始终令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%3D0%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F55f412502280d32c04501bf89b1aec2c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nWPlx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0112adde" id="u0112adde">，算子则保持静态，拓宽后的残差流不引入额外计算，从而恢复为前述简化 AltUp 变体</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u653e6a80" id="u653e6a80"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95afbb60" id="u95afbb60">从静态算子出发，实验结果支持以下设计选择</span></strong></p><ul list="u9bd6ba0a"><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="u531c7e72" id="u531c7e72"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3981c74c" id="u3981c74c">采用有界的正值门控：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf147c2d2" id="uf147c2d2">sigmoid 在损失与训练稳定性方面均优于 tanh，与 mHC 的结论一致，也与 GDN 和注意力组件中的门控实验结果相符</span></li><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="u2d7119c2" id="u2d7119c2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u54d82499" id="u54d82499">使读写权重依赖输入：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uacd8c84b" id="uacd8c84b">相较于预归一化基线，静态拓宽方案使损失降低 0.021、平均基准得分提高 1.58 分；进一步引入数据依赖的读写权重，仅使损失再降低 0.002，却带来额外 1.98 分的基准提升。仅依据损失，会低估动态读写的价值</span></li><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="u1bb7d6c9" id="u1bb7d6c9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua44b979d" id="ua44b979d" style="color: #5C0036">细化读取粒度，保留标量写入：将读取权重从每个分支一个标量细化为每个分支、每个通道一个权重能够带来收益；对写入权重进行同样的细化则几乎没有收益，因此写入仍采用每分支一个标量</span></strong></li><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="u48534fa1" id="u48534fa1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3af9b351" id="u3af9b351">利用全部分支预测算子，并分别归一化：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u11ab78fe" id="u11ab78fe">使用全部分支优于仅使用最后一个分支或先对分支池化；对每个分支独立执行 RMSNorm，即对拓宽后的残差流采用分组 RMSNorm，还能进一步改善表现</span></li><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="uccbe60a8" id="uccbe60a8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u703f723d" id="u703f723d">移除分支混合算子：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1c1a0b1c" id="u1c1a0b1c">当读取与写入具有足够的表达能力后，增加</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_r%5C%5Ctimes%20n_r%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff0cdab4963ffd59714a22973f343c264.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KKaKy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue072165e" id="ue072165e">的混合算子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc600cd47484dc83697fdca86b7d2825.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t9Ylq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub8fedbe3" id="ub8fedbe3">不再带来显著收益</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5978b364" id="u5978b364" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793502728389-143cdf58-a5f1-49d9-a020-f9cd0c06330d.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u94104952-95dd-4db2-b935-9f67360cd18%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u42c7b814-fcd2-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A940.2000732421875%2C%22height%22%3A151%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A111465%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1339%2C%22originHeight%22%3A215%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22LUMMLU-PROSUPERGP%22%2C%22x%22%3A287%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A280%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MLUEVALPLUSMULTIPL%22%2C%22x%22%3A979%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A251%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EASONINGMULTILINGU%22%2C%22x%22%3A806%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A212%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MHCDYNAMIC%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A156%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2241.3054.47%22%2C%22x%22%3A1202%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2242.0054.66%22%2C%22x%22%3A1202%2C%22y%22%3A169%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NOWLEDGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A381%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MATHGSMSK%22%2C%22x%22%3A618%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2240.9452.49%22%2C%22x%22%3A1199%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MHC(STATIC%22%2C%22x%22%3A14%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RESIDUA%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2266.54%22%2C%22x%22%3A842%2C%22y%22%3A169%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.594%22%2C%22x%22%3A203%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2266.69%22%2C%22x%22%3A278%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2266.01%22%2C%22x%22%3A844%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2259.54%22%2C%22x%22%3A634%2C%22y%22%3A146%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2224.20%22%2C%22x%22%3A548%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2266.11%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PRE-NORM%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A105%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.590%22%2C%22x%22%3A200%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2246.02%22%2C%22x%22%3A410%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2237.1550.91%22%2C%22x%22%3A1190%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2261.18%22%2C%22x%22%3A629%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2223.80%22%2C%22x%22%3A546%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2252.16%22%2C%22x%22%3A1085%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2264.73%22%2C%22x%22%3A843%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2245.84%22%2C%22x%22%3A410%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2278.20%22%2C%22x%22%3A726%2C%22y%22%3A167%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEM%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2222.20%22%2C%22x%22%3A547%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2278.51%22%2C%22x%22%3A728%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CODE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1121%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2264.29%22%2C%22x%22%3A256%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2251.26%22%2C%22x%22%3A975%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2252.78%22%2C%22x%22%3A982%2C%22y%22%3A118%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2243.69%22%2C%22x%22%3A410%2C%22y%22%3A122%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2249.59%22%2C%22x%22%3A1081%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2249.25%22%2C%22x%22%3A1073%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AVG.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1260%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2255.08%22%2C%22x%22%3A637%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2264.62%22%2C%22x%22%3A280%2C%22y%22%3A122%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BBH%22%2C%22x%22%3A827%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2278.05%22%2C%22x%22%3A728%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GR%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2251.36%22%2C%22x%22%3A1085%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.596%22%2C%22x%22%3A205%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2265.42%22%2C%22x%22%3A844%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2256.19%22%2C%22x%22%3A981%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2238.40%22%2C%22x%22%3A394%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2277.41%22%2C%22x%22%3A718%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.617%22%2C%22x%22%3A203%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2221.78%22%2C%22x%22%3A535%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2253.92%22%2C%22x%22%3A629%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f0ef%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u13433412%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9388a4ee" id="u9388a4ee"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3baffdf" id="ua3baffdf" style="color: #AD1A2B">门控残差（Gated Residual，GR）：在 RMSNorm 之后加入轻量级的逐元素自门控，能够显著改善训练稳定性。将这一操作称为 GatedNorm</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue5ccf86d" id="ue5ccf86d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BGatedNorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D)%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_2%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_1%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B29%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c9875a7290eb37c6782bbf1ef0821e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jaTsE%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uba22f1f6"><li fid="u5ae72d7b" data-lake-id="u1ce67382" id="u1ce67382"><span data-lake-id="u5f023259" id="u5f023259">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4bf69ac16829eb6c819176c2cddd6e76.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22upcpu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u989cf9b1" id="u989cf9b1">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faa94d4732c805b098b2cab79acbd56c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xWFcI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a8407a0" id="u1a8407a0">构成一个低秩瓶颈。采用 sigmoid 门控、逐元素且依赖输入的读取，恰好对应于将式（29）应用于拓宽后的残差流。因此，将二者合并为一个算子，并将其称为门控残差。GR 首先对每个分支独立归一化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u43955cb8" id="u43955cb8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%3B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cni%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cn_r%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B30%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff30b28144888a0dbeeb6a76dbfbdbae5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YH0Hz%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue5c8be90"><li fid="u984e44c7" data-lake-id="u4ec32ebd" id="u4ec32ebd"><span data-lake-id="uc9a6063d" id="uc9a6063d">每个分支具有独立的缩放参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7c671657c321560571aef7c86fedd632.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DM7kC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua750bcc0" id="ua750bcc0">。随后，根据全部分支，为每个分支的每个通道预测门控分数，并对门控后的分支取平均，得到块输入</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc4d3437c" id="uc4d3437c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BG%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bunvec%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_u%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn_r%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_d%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_r%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B31%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd4a420211226c3c87fd2da6430103498.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OD9Xs%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc23710e1" id="uc23710e1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn_r%7D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bn_r%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BG%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B32%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F982ef996798fc36f54e5a5e4ab3707dc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uJZ4H%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue45c46f5"><li fid="u3fd3d007" data-lake-id="ucf5e174a" id="ucf5e174a"><span data-lake-id="ueb362ece" id="ueb362ece">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F24ef7fdddd85415b2a050f866520d1a2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eOANo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uff8839bb" id="uff8839bb">将各分支拼接为长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22n_rd%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86583318430cfa26f8ed854d1d148543.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Vr3a4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40c906d9" id="u40c906d9"> 的向量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bunvec%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F15b21b058483b9dbf7cf73e3d86cd976.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J5nYA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc2c2562" id="ubc2c2562">为其逆操作。投影矩阵满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_d%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Br%5C%5Ctimes%20n_rd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2d447f6713c75774f237beb2dc8c8116.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fOkS2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93b8f571" id="u93b8f571">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_u%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_rd%5C%5Ctimes%20r%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F906adaf39e9db8be943ea59b7812a9cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i2thU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u005d64c4" id="u005d64c4">，瓶颈秩设为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r%3Dd%2F8%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F73774dac1c7cfdf5b984057c15257689.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ikBjw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b458114" id="u4b458114">。块输出 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feaa8f1510ec51b4762191e348a423fee.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IVp4z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f34bc02" id="u2f34bc02"> 通过每个分支各自的数据依赖标量，写入所有分支</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf03bb7c6" id="uf03bb7c6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn2%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn_r%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_w%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cright)%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_r%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B33%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F464da00b0d401e78260eb4a4d873ea20.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SEBNP%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf4334296" id="uf4334296" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i'%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%2Bs_i%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B34%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53287e00e7154c7de3503f96edfbe665.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YUxoz%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u04ca7260"><li fid="u02bc4fcf" data-lake-id="ua732f9b3" id="ua732f9b3"><span data-lake-id="ucb46992f" id="ucb46992f">激活函数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%3D%5C%5Csigma%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faca0ef92013a2108036a14c080a94a6c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22shOYi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7cb1549f" id="u7cb1549f">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F625a0a26bb0652e2e318ad3f78537dfc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CWmoR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u25f76d78" id="u25f76d78">采用逐元素权重，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51ba8d61bf2240e2837efe718bad9e01.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zVfnv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u36a1d9cd" id="u36a1d9cd">采用每分支一个标量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1ad710db3776f84d29166b21c62c1242.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tVcBM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u53903802" id="u53903802">则对应对全部分支执行分组 RMSNorm 后的结果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u669a9dda" id="u669a9dda"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf56c1fe8" id="uf56c1fe8" style="color: #AD1A2B">GR 与动态 mHC 的主要差别在于采用逐元素的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F625a0a26bb0652e2e318ad3f78537dfc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oXKN0%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5994d7df" id="u5994d7df" style="color: #AD1A2B">，以及移除</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc600cd47484dc83697fdca86b7d2825.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w5pmq%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd261595" id="ufd261595" style="color: #AD1A2B">；GR 的效率优势在于，移除</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc600cd47484dc83697fdca86b7d2825.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CiRyy%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u88d565af" id="u88d565af" style="color: #AD1A2B">后，每个块可减少一次对完整残差状态的读取，从而降低访存开销</span></strong></p><ul list="u30ba047d"><li fid="u3146d7ee" data-lake-id="ua919d362" id="ua919d362"><span data-lake-id="u88937185" id="u88937185">其稳定性优势来自两个方面：GatedNorm 本身能够改善训练稳定性；同时，移除需要额外约束的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc600cd47484dc83697fdca86b7d2825.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nurlg%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39bc9abb" id="u39bc9abb">，也消除一个潜在的不稳定来源</span></li><li fid="u3146d7ee" data-lake-id="u97002ab7" id="u97002ab7"><span data-lake-id="u29287d9b" id="u29287d9b">GR 与 HC、mHC 和 VWN 属于同一类方法，区别在于如何分配新增的表达能力。HC 和 mHC 将读取与写入保留为每分支标量，并通过 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc600cd47484dc83697fdca86b7d2825.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jvjmG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf492ccf" id="ubf492ccf"> 增强表达能力；mHC 进一步要求该矩阵满足双随机约束。VWN 同样保留这些标量，但通过拓宽词元嵌入并将其划分为多个较窄的片段，实现更细粒度的读写</span></li><li fid="u3146d7ee" data-lake-id="u9a3c709a" id="u9a3c709a"><span data-lake-id="u6bb07bee" id="u6bb07bee">GR 则将表达能力主要用于读取，采用逐元素门控，并完全移除 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc600cd47484dc83697fdca86b7d2825.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gTL60%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8352651a" id="u8352651a">。这一移除不会损害表现，同时避免每个块对整个残差状态的一次读取，而这正是拓宽残差流后推理开销的主要来源</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u43d25d1b" id="u43d25d1b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2ae3b659" id="u2ae3b659" style="color: #AD1A2B">消融实验表明，GR 能够同时改善损失与基准表现。利用 GR 不包含残差分支混合这一特点，将每个分支视为历史输出的累加器，从而精确分解每个块读取的内容中，来自各个先前块的贡献。通过与其他配置相同、但不使用 GR 的参考模型进行比较，发现新增宽度主要被用于若干特定路径：一个分支跨越多层保留早期注意力输出，其余三个分支则主要承担局部信息传递</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc3852887" id="uc3852887" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1793502661376-171bce46-cced-4ee4-99d7-dc9f56b94b08.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u355c607c-6d61-4deb-9fa8-eee8dad60f2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u7c600ed2-9510-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A675%2C%22height%22%3A379%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A120425%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1310%2C%22originHeight%22%3A735%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22PATH(WIDTH%3ACONNECTIONSTRENGTH)%22%2C%22x%22%3A324%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A276%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LO6.GDN%22%2C%22x%22%3A392%2C%22y%22%3A652%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LIO.GDN%22%2C%22x%22%3A627%2C%22y%22%3A651%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTMAX-ATTNLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A920%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A152%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L03.ATTN%22%2C%22x%22%3A224%2C%22y%22%3A479%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LO0.NLP%22%2C%22x%22%3A162%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LHATN%22%2C%22x%22%3A738%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WRITER%22%2C%22x%22%3A667%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L13.GDN%22%2C%22x%22%3A794%2C%22y%22%3A303%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L00.MLP%22%2C%22x%22%3A77%2C%22y%22%3A304%2C%22width%22%3A82%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L19.ATTN%22%2C%22x%22%3A1210%2C%22y%22%3A623%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BL.ATTN%22%2C%22x%22%3A732%2C%22y%22%3A624%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OREADE%22%2C%22x%22%3A748%2C%22y%22%3A183%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L1S.ATTN%22%2C%22x%22%3A978%2C%22y%22%3A622%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L07.ATTN%22%2C%22x%22%3A511%2C%22y%22%3A450%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OO.GDN%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L15.ATTN%22%2C%22x%22%3A978%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L07.ATTN%22%2C%22x%22%3A505%2C%22y%22%3A623%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1231%2C%22y%22%3A699%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L19.ATTN%22%2C%22x%22%3A1211%2C%22y%22%3A101%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2212%22%2C%22x%22%3A769%2C%22y%22%3A697%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2216%22%2C%22x%22%3A1004%2C%22y%22%3A696%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A9%2C%22y%22%3A82%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B3%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A604%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A428%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f9f9%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u40b63c73%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf0c9602f"><li fid="u54d8e8c3" data-lake-id="u29f0b7f2" id="u29f0b7f2"><span data-lake-id="uae591b87" id="uae591b87">长程分支主要在第 0 层接收写入，此后更新较少，因此早期信息能够持续被后续层访问。从 GR 分支中读取较多信息的子层主要是 softmax 注意力层，表明全局注意力承担整合显式长程历史上下文的重要作用</span></li><li fid="u54d8e8c3" data-lake-id="uf1e4d5fa" id="uf1e4d5fa"><span data-lake-id="u23fc295e" id="u23fc295e">总体上，GR 增强部分相邻层路径和长程路径，同时削弱中程路径。加权平均跨层跨度基本不变（3.97 与 3.91），变化主要体现在信息传递的分布上：少量特定路径获得更高的贡献权重</span></li></ul>